BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:March to the Polls -Warren Township
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261024T083000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261024T100000
UID:fca2c004afac14a10254f4c0f8d0a3c6@mobilize.us
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://mobilize-uploads-prod.s3.amazonaws.com/u
 ploads/event/Mobilize_20260920162246495333.png
DESCRIPTION:### March to the Polls - Warren Township Millions of Americans
  have joined together to reject power grabs and voter suppression. Now\, w
 e are taking the next step: moving from protest to participation\, making 
 sure we are ready to vote early and choose our own leaders. No king\, no p
 olitician\, and no president gets to decide who wins an election. The star
 ting point for this march will be a short walk from the voting center. Thi
 s march will take place rain or shine\, except in the case of thunderstor
LOCATION:Warren Township Education Center\, 975 N Post Rd\, Indianapolis\,
  IN\, 46219
URL:https://www.mobilize.us/indivisiblecentralindiana/event/1040557/
X-SOURCE:Indivisible Central Indiana (Mobilize)
END:VEVENT
